{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026. Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies.[[cite:obs-8ef10c22fec9d771aa19a25b9d32c7b81cb314e4 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"28ec0154ab3c55f27496f0e8be60d3691f8ac53ebfff90f82d013eac47348a80","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement about 10:00 to 16:00 core hours from the staff handbook, as the board resolution overrides it. Kept only the board resolution core hours statement with its citation, fulfilling the requirement that where they differ, the resolution applies."}